#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "164_Saejima"
msgid "Seems like you've still got a bit o' fuel left in yer tank. We're practicin' a bit more today."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "176_Ochiai"
msgid "What? Uh, no. That's enough for today. And anyway, I'm starting to get sleepy."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "188_Sodachi"
msgid "Oh, no you don't! You know what they say, perseverance leads to success!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200_Sodachi"
msgid "You're never going to become a champion with an attitude like that!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "212_Ochiai"
msgid "Oh, shut up. I don't take orders from weaklings like you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "224_Ochiai"
msgid "I'm going to sleep, and that's that. Seeya, old man."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "260_Sodachi"
msgid "Hm? Is that a cell phone ringing?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "272_Ochiai"
msgid "Oh, it's mine! Ugh..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Sodachi"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "¿Qué cosa?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "296_Ochiai"
msgid "Shit. It's my dad..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Saejima"
msgid "Dad?"
msgstr "¿Papá?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "344_Ochiai"
msgid "Hello? How's it going? Okay... Hm... Yeah... Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "368_Ochiai"
msgid "Right now? I'm training at the dojo. And really hard too! You'd be impressed!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "380_Ochiai"
msgid "No, I'm serious. I'm not sleeping! I promise! I've been training without breaks! Boy, am I tired!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "392_Ochiai"
msgid "Huh? That sounds suspicious? You want to talk to my teacher?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "404_Ochiai"
msgid "Okay... Hold on..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "464_Ochiai"
msgid "You're going to have to talk to my dad. And don't think about saying anything funny, got it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "476_Ochiai"
msgid "Tell him I'm an excellent and talented student!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "548_Saejima"
msgid "Hello. The name's Saejima. I handle all o' the teachin' at this dojo."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "560_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "Oh, you work at the dojo?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "572_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "I'm Fukushi Ochiai's father. Thank you for looking after him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "584_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "I just wanted to ask... Is he causing you any trouble?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "596_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "I'm a little bit worried. He tends to... march to the beat of his own drum, if you know what I mean."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "608_Saejima"
msgid "Well, now that ya mention it..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "620_Ochiai"
msgid "Aaaaaaargh!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "632_Ochiai"
msgid "Raaa! Aaah! This training is really kicking my butt today!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "644_Ochiai"
msgid "But I have to keep on working! Aaaaaargh! Haaa!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "656_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "668_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "Is my son taking his training seriously?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "680_Saejima"
msgid "To be honest, he ain't serious at all. But he's got potential."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "692_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "I see. I'm sorry, but do you think that you could put Fukushi back on?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "704_Saejima"
msgid "Uh... Right..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "716_Ochiai"
msgid "Fuckin' bastard... You're going to regret that!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "752_Ochiai"
msgid "Hello, Dad? Oh, that guy? Yeah, he just likes to joke around."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "764_Ochiai"
msgid "That was just a lie, you know. I'm working really hard. Yep... you bet."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "812_Ochiai"
msgid "Why didn't you listen to me!? I had to listen to him lecture me for like an hour after that! Give me a fuckin' break already!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "824_Saejima"
msgid "(Serves 'im right. But now our relationship's turned for the worse.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "848_Saejima"
msgid "He's been trainin' hard. Ya ain't got a reason to worry."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "860_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "Really? That's a big relief to hear. Tell him to keep up the hard work."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "872_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "Thank you, Saejima-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "944_Saejima"
msgid "There. Is that what ya wanted?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "956_Ochiai"
msgid "Thanks, old man! You were perfect! You ever consider being an actor? What a convincing performance. My trust in you has grown. Slightly."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "968_Ochiai"
msgid "Well, I'm going to sleep. Night, old man!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "980_Saejima"
msgid "(Well, at least he trusts me more now...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1004_Saejima"
msgid "He's a phenomenon! One-in-a-million! He's the model apprentice－always workin' hard, and always aspirin' to be better."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1016_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "Really... Did Fukushi tell you to say that?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1028_Saejima"
msgid "That's not..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1040_Fukushi's Father"
msgid "Sorry to have caused you trouble. Please give the phone back to Fukushi."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1052_Saejima"
msgid "Uh... Right..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1064_Ochiai"
msgid "Come on! What the hell are you doing!? You didn't have to take it that far! Make it sound at least a little realistic!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1100_Ochiai"
msgid "Dad? Yeah... No, I wouldn't do such a thing. I'm training really hard, you know... Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1148_Ochiai"
msgid "I was stupid to trust you! That was such a lame attempt! You're a terrible actor! Absolute crap! Idiot!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1160_Saejima"
msgid "(Fuckin' kid.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1256_Saejima"
msgid "He ain't serious at all."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1268_Saejima"
msgid "He's been trainin' seriously."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1280_Saejima"
msgid "He's one-in-a-million."
msgstr ""

